            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.841,
            0.645,
            0.927
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A Foucault pendulum with a length of 22 metres has been hung from a skylight in the Constitutionhas been hung from a skylight in the Constitution Hall of the new Parliament building in New Delhi,Hall of the new Parliament building in New Delhi, India. It symbolises the integration of the idea ofIndia. It symbolises the integration of the idea of India with the vastness of the cosmos.India with the vastness of the cosmos."
            }
          ]
        },
